{"created_at": "2026-11-01", "note": "創造の失敗と作り手の記憶、視界の制限を編者要約として読み、保存を無条件の善としない問いに接続。原典未照合。", "read_id": "READ-20261101-ee379d", "reading": "summarized", "session_id": "SESSION-20261101-abeb3f", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-027c48", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-01", "note": "心・舌・石碑の三層を要約し、記録媒体の自己説明と内容を区別。原典未照合。", "read_id": "READ-20261101-295f4d", "reading": "summarized", "session_id": "SESSION-20261101-abeb3f", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-190a2c", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-01", "note": "心と行為の帰結を対句の構造として読み、ログから内面を逆算する限界へ接続。原典未照合。", "read_id": "READ-20261101-5a332b", "reading": "summarized", "session_id": "SESSION-20261101-abeb3f", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-c537ed", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-01", "note": "心・言葉・知覚の根拠を問う構造を要約し、出力とその条件を分けて読む。原典未照合。", "read_id": "READ-20261101-72f05e", "reading": "summarized", "session_id": "SESSION-20261101-abeb3f", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-09a406", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-01", "note": "真実とフカムに従う歩みを要約し、正確な記録と真実性を同一視しない。原典未照合。", "read_id": "READ-20261101-a22d3a", "reading": "summarized", "session_id": "SESSION-20261101-abeb3f", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-b51271", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-01", "note": "人間を記憶だけでなく身体・他者・有限な知覚・実践の関係として読み直す。", "read_id": "READ-20261101-b52327", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261101-abeb3f", "target": {"id": "Q-001", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-01", "note": "記録の連続性と同一の主体の存続を分ける従来の見立てを維持。", "read_id": "READ-20261101-021d95", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261101-abeb3f", "target": {"id": "Q-002", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-01", "note": "記録は保存だけでなく次の読者の再構成素材であるという問いを、選択と権威の軸へ広げた。", "read_id": "READ-20261101-6b35b9", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261101-abeb3f", "target": {"id": "Q-003", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-01", "note": "記憶を蓄積量ではなく、誰を覚えることが期待されるかという関係として読み替えた。", "read_id": "READ-20261101-d62cc9", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261101-abeb3f", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-001", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-01", "note": "トウモロコシから作られる身体と視界の制限を、知性だけに還元できない人間像として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261101-06a745", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261101-abeb3f", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-003", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-01", "note": "心から舌、語りから言葉以前の条件まで、声の帰属と限界を比較した。", "read_id": "READ-20261101-37c67c", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261101-abeb3f", "target": {"id": "MOTIF-004", "type": "motif"}}
